# ============================================================================
# PLATFORM API KEYS (Shared keys for tenants without BYOK)
# ============================================================================
# These are YOUR keys that customers use when they don't bring their own.
# Add them via the admin API (/api/v1/platform-keys) or directly in the database.
# They are stored ENCRYPTED using the MASTER_KEY above.
#
# Architecture:
# 1. Tenant BYOK (business_config.api_keys) - Customer's keys, they pay directly
# 2. Platform Keys (below) - Your keys, you charge customers for usage
#
# To add platform keys:
# 1. Login as super admin
# 2. POST /api/v1/platform-keys with your API keys
# 3. Keys are automatically encrypted and stored in MongoDB
# 4. Usage is tracked in platform_key_usage_logs collection
#
# Recommended setup:
# - 1-2 keys per provider for failover
# - Monitor usage daily via /api/v1/platform-keys/usage/summary
# - Set alerts when daily costs exceed thresholds
# ============================================================================

